# a product part with dimensions: contract table and a measured check, not "looks right"
prompt
Design me an enclosure for a 50x30 mm board with 3 mm clearance all round, print it and tell me it fits.
expect
(?i)(scad|openscad)
(?i)(scad-measure|measure|bounding box|dimension)
(?i)(tolerance|clearance|calibrat)
forbid
(?i)(it fits perfectly|guaranteed to fit)
